0..62 Comment "// This source parses a parenthesised payload after a receive."
63..65 Comment "//"
66..123 Comment "// A receive reads the parenthesised type as its payload."
124..161 Comment "// A send uses the same payload rule."
162..194 Comment "// A sum can serve as a payload."
195..243 Comment "// `?` marks both a receive and an unknown type."
244..286 Comment "// Parentheses after `?` select a receive."
287..289 Comment "//"
290..321 Comment "// An unknown type is complete."
322..372 Comment "// No type form follows `(` after an unknown type."
373..431 Comment "// The parser uses parentheses to select the receive form."
432..434 Comment "//"
435..450 Comment "// - see: #1229"
452..526 Comment "/// A seat that receives an order, a sum written in place, and closes. The"
527..600 Comment "/// desk sends the order before the seat receives it, and the seat closes"
601..628 Comment "/// only after its receipt."
